{
 "title": "Mamba-130M",
 "description": "Mamba (state-spaces/mamba-130m, as transformers' MambaForCausalLM): token embeddings, 24 MambaBlocks (RMSNorm, then the selective state space mixer: input projections, a causal depthwise convolution, input-dependent \u0394, B and C, and the scan h = exp(\u0394\u00b7A) \u2299 h_prev + \u0394\u00b7B\u00b7u drawn flat with a Delay, read out by C, plus D\u00b7u, gated by SiLU(z)), a final RMSNorm and an LM head tied to the embeddings, trained on the next token. 129M parameters, the same as the reference.",
